{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18074","headline":"人日城南登高 · 韩愈","name":"人日城南登高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初正候才兆，涉七气已弄。\n霭霭野浮阳，晖晖水披冻。\n圣朝身不废，佳节古所用。\n亲交既许来，子妷亦可从。\n盘蔬冬春杂，尊酒清浊共。\n令徵前事爲，觞咏新诗送。\n扶杖凌圮址，刺船犯枯葑。\n恋池羣鸭回，释峤孤云纵。\n人生本坦荡，谁使妄倥偬。\n直指桃李阑，幽寻宁止重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}